{
  "name": "certified_exchange_residual_guard",
  "features": [
    {
      "name": "residual_pack",
      "expression": {"op":"greedy_independent_weight","args":[{"op":"difference","args":[{"op":"difference","args":[{"op":"available","args":[]},{"op":"neighbors","args":[{"op":"root","args":[]}]}]},{"op":"singleton","args":[{"op":"root","args":[]}]}]}]}
    },
    {
      "name": "residual_cover",
      "expression": {"op":"clique_cover_weight","args":[{"op":"difference","args":[{"op":"difference","args":[{"op":"available","args":[]},{"op":"neighbors","args":[{"op":"root","args":[]}]}]},{"op":"singleton","args":[{"op":"root","args":[]}]}]}]}
    },
    {
      "name": "neighbor_pack",
      "expression": {"op":"greedy_independent_weight","args":[{"op":"intersection","args":[{"op":"neighbors","args":[{"op":"root","args":[]}]},{"op":"available","args":[]}]}]}
    },
    {
      "name": "neighbor_cover",
      "expression": {"op":"clique_cover_weight","args":[{"op":"intersection","args":[{"op":"neighbors","args":[{"op":"root","args":[]}]},{"op":"available","args":[]}]}]}
    },
    {
      "name": "boundary_edges",
      "expression": {"op":"sub","args":[{"op":"sub","args":[{"op":"count","args":[{"op":"induced_edges","args":[{"op":"difference","args":[{"op":"available","args":[]},{"op":"singleton","args":[{"op":"root","args":[]}]}]}]}]},{"op":"count","args":[{"op":"induced_edges","args":[{"op":"intersection","args":[{"op":"neighbors","args":[{"op":"root","args":[]}]},{"op":"available","args":[]}]}]}]}]},{"op":"count","args":[{"op":"induced_edges","args":[{"op":"difference","args":[{"op":"difference","args":[{"op":"available","args":[]},{"op":"neighbors","args":[{"op":"root","args":[]}]}]},{"op":"singleton","args":[{"op":"root","args":[]}]}]}]}]}]}
    },
    {
      "name": "active_weight",
      "expression": {"op":"sum_weights","args":[{"op":"available","args":[]}]}
    }
  ],
  "rule": "(2 + (weight + 0.1*residual_pack)/max(1e-9,abs(active_weight))) if neighbor_cover <= weight else ((weight + residual_pack - 0.35*max(0,residual_cover-residual_pack) - 0.2*max(0,neighbor_pack-weight))/max(1e-9,abs(active_weight)) + 0.03*boundary_edges/max(1,degree*(1+remaining_count)))",
  "rationale": "The parents are identical: their common backbone combines root reward, residual packing and clique-cover estimates, neighbor opportunity cost, and boundary relief. This heuristic explores certified exchanges and completion confidence. A neighbor clique-cover bound no greater than root weight certifies that selecting the root can replace every feasible selection among its active neighbors without losing reward; these roots receive first priority. Other roots are ranked by their feasible inclusion completion, penalized for residual bound uncertainty and packed neighbor reward exceeding their own weight. Normalized boundary relief supplies a small structural correction. All features use the current available graph."
}